  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together vegetable oil, zesty, fish sauce, brown sugar, lime juice, and chili flakes.",
    "3. Add the chopped croatian and minced garlic to the bowl and mix well.",
    "4. Add the shrimp to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "5. Thread the shrimp and croatian onto the skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "6. Brush the grill with oil to prevent sticking.",
    "7. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, or until the shrimp are pink and the croatian is lightly charred.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
